set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term BGP from source-address 10.0.23.2/32
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term BGP from protocol tcp
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term BGP from port bgp
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term BGP then accept
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term ICMP from protocol icmp
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term ICMP then accept
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term WEB from destination-address 172.16.20.0/24
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term WEB from protocol tcp
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term WEB from destination-port [ http https ]
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term WEB then accept
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term SSH from source-address 203.0.113.0/24
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term SSH from destination-address 172.16.20.0/24
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term SSH from protocol tcp
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term SSH from destination-port ssh
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term SSH then accept
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term DENY then count ISP-DENY
set firewall family inet filter FROM-ISP term DENY then discard
set interfaces et-0/0/1 unit 0 family inet filter input FROM-ISP
